{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "00f2a7bf2d422abf8ce6795dd40f7f00d531c8cd6de7911516058eae39c46c99", "ja": "（雛祭りライブまであと数日。真は連日残って\nレッスンをしている。こっちも演出を詰めないと）", "zh": "（离女儿节演唱会还有几天。真最近每天都留下来练习，\n我也要把舞台效果做好才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "0262f1097361018c07f082dcc855273360c9d75139aca358ac9ea0a2c1dee222", "ja": "あ、いたいた、{$P$}！\nお疲れさまですっ！", "zh": "啊，原来你在这里，{$P$}！\n工作辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8c65e60fef866f1c94f255d16f863a053d879ed633b8a7a6e0d7a7d18f8a2d2f", "ja": "ああ、お疲れ、真。\n着替えもしないで、どうした？", "zh": "嗯，辛苦了，真。\n你怎么没换衣服呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "14579a388c991ffb0ec4d68bbe642b5806ab9d9ffc17212d3dcd5d93b27ff026", "ja": "{$P$}にお願いがあるんです！\nボク、ちょっと考えてることがあって。", "zh": "在下有件事情想拜托{$P$}！\n其实在下有个想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1004_p", "source_sha256": "09481a39fe5a1643c9ea8a674d7db9aa0f7893adf802c5d10be44868969c23b7", "ja": "考えてること？", "zh": "想法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "141c9a0e3cf52dce585441dc6749d93dd1aa64d02fd2cd4ea75ffb79ecb0627b", "ja": "はい。この前、ひな壇の飾り付けをさせて\nもらってから、ずっと気になってるんですけど……", "zh": "是的。之前帮忙装饰娃娃坛后，\n在下就一直在想一件事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "fc012d02eea44dc13386fe05150ea5e75f8707cef1c52a0061e00d3a765ac673", "ja": "どうしてお雛さまって、\nあんなにカワイク見えるんですかね？", "zh": "为什么皇后的娃娃\n看起来会那么可爱呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4ac0810321e0cb577355cfd8abc359426ead7c9bd4d1656bd3bf9a856abfb490", "ja": "え？　どうしても何も……\nかわいく作られてるから、じゃないか？", "zh": "呃？这能有什么原因吗……\n应该是因为它本来就做得很可爱吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "5a1e08c4691c0f06662bab0252dfabeeae5b4e69cd5f88c2fc92106595df39f9", "ja": "そんな見た目だけの問題じゃないと思うんです！\n人間、やっぱり中身が大事ですよね！", "zh": "在下觉得不是外观上的问题！\n一个人最重要的还是内在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a27fb7ed6cd39b1d8bdab4fa51c24359e0a7ae0374e9ad89627bb8930d7308a3", "ja": "そ、そうだな！\nお雛さまは人形だが……まあいい。", "zh": "你、你说得对！\n但它们是人偶吧……算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "684b9027867805325df38b09c39a30cd63e90f29ca64045c6d2cd1c5a1f7524a", "ja": "それで、ふと気がついたんですよ。\nお雛さまって……。", "zh": "然后，在下突然发现了一件事。\n皇后的娃娃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "b135fef86839477c1f3511c6ed74e865aad76e499e81a92e602557a4850843c6", "ja": "お内裏さまとペアで並んでる時の方が、\nかわいく見える気がしませんか？", "zh": "跟天皇的娃娃放一起时，\n看起来比较可爱吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b9ae6291efc67a3e36074b5328db37b62a155e8313732430f25c7bf05df56b67", "ja": "うーん。まあ、そう言われると、\n並んでる方が可愛いような気が……しなくもないかな？", "zh": "唔──经你这么一说，\n放在一起好像……有比较可爱吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "3bf2c4479087f1b3f1bcc1dcc8c4d6950ed2b442ca7e687f7e17a49bd09970e9", "ja": "ですよねっ！　うまく言えないんですけど、\n二人そろってるからこその魅力があると思うんです！", "zh": "对吧！在下也不太会表达，\n但在下觉得它们俩放在一起时别具魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "cdc046b53896d67c99b7752438320f0197a60ce30f7b865a51a80523f2512c85", "ja": "というわけで、{$P$}！\nお内裏さま、よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "所以说呢，{$P$}！\n就拜托你担任天皇娃娃啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d93c45bae6119b027327ecbce149bb7fa040f1b291981895c4e9a0eb29b572b9", "ja": "えっ？　俺が……何だって？", "zh": "咦？你要我……担任什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "2c676007aa34cde23a728ef1b94d28d92f6115eb84607c20d165c53d3c6b5809", "ja": "お内裏さま、です！　お雛さまの極意を身につける\nために、まず、お内裏さまと並んでみたくて。", "zh": "天皇娃娃啊！为了学会皇后娃娃的真髓，\n在下想先试试和天皇娃娃搭档。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "b8d240c563a8a058889e60fd640893525e93ed15517f89e4ee09a9276c230398", "ja": "ボクのお内裏さまといえば、その……。\n{$P$}に決まってるじゃないですか。", "zh": "而说到在下的搭档，就是……\n当然就是{$P$}啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8a48e1f10ebf7933d60e3306498027e55833c9ea4af6cfad1c1db50b892a0a2e", "ja": "真……。よし、心意気はわかった。\nとことん付き合うよ！", "zh": "真……好，我了解你的决心了。\n我就奉陪到底吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "1935c380e48ed994ebe94961872df8b36875ae3aad224fc67a09928b7f22a74f", "ja": "やーりぃ！　ありがとうございますっ！\nじゃあ、ステージの上に座ってもらって～。", "zh": "太棒啦！谢谢制作人！\n那就请你到舞台上坐着～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d7cfdb2dd185731ed7fe1df0de686cf2a8d373c61cd78b72e630f2fa50f82069", "ja": "ああ、わかった！　よいしょっと……。", "zh": "好，我知道了！嘿咻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "b73a85a54d699bfc577df963ac2e34eeb658e5ff96677f71d7d6d2657a8f2c42", "ja": "隣、失礼しますっ！\nく～っ、ついにボクもお雛さまかぁ……えへへっ♪", "zh": "旁边借坐啰！\n唔～在下终于能当皇后娃娃了……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0054_1022_p", "source_sha256": "88c9102c23b8e1774d88064ffeb839e3c4478d925f92757439d4eaeb4af0c9c0", "ja": "（お雛さまデビューに声を弾ませ、はしゃいでいる。\nお内裏さまとして、これからも隣で見守るとしよう）", "zh": "（真第一次当皇后娃娃，她的声音十分兴奋，兴高采烈。\n我身为她的天皇娃娃，以后也继续在身边看顾她吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
